      "description": "Scrollable Rust example with quiet copy action.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-code\"><div class=\"ds-toolbar\"><span>main.rs</span><button class=\"ds-copy\">Copy</button></div><pre><code><span class=\"ds-keyword\">let</span> processed = audio.gain_db(-3.0)?;</code></pre></div>",
      "css": ".ds-code{background:var(--code,#18213e);color:#eef1ff;border-radius:var(--radius,12px);overflow:hidden;min-width:0}.ds-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:15px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #394464;font:12px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;color:#b6c3e5}.ds-copy{border:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;font:inherit;padding:4px;cursor:pointer}.ds-copy:hover{color:white}.ds-copy:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#6841cb);outline-offset:4px}.ds-code pre{margin:0;overflow:auto;padding:25px 22px;font:13px/1.85 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;tab-size:4}.ds-code code{font:inherit}.ds-keyword{color:#bfafff}"
